%% ZTFA — one federated round (HLD §5.2 Figure 3)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant IoT as IoT Sensor
    participant C as Client Node
    participant A as Aggregator
    participant Chain as FederationRound.sol
    participant V as Verifier.sol

    IoT->>C: stream labeled + unlabeled records
    A->>Chain: startRound(t)
    Note over C: train E epochs<br/>on labeled partition
    Note over C: c_i = CKKS.Enc(w_i)<br/>H_i = Poseidon(t || cid || c_i)
    C->>A: POST /v1/round/{t}/submit (c_i)
    C->>Chain: submitClientCommitment(t, H_i) {fee}
    Note over A: c_sum = Σ c_i (homomorphic add)
    Note over A: π ← Groth16.Prove(circuit, witness)
    A->>Chain: submitAggregateAndProof(t, H_agg, π)
    Chain->>V: verifyProof(π, H[], H_agg)
    V-->>Chain: true
    Chain->>A: pay aggregatorPayment
    Chain-->>C: RoundVerified(t, H_agg) event
    C->>A: GET /v1/round/{t}/aggregate
    A-->>C: c_sum bytes
    Note over C: w_global = Dec(c_sum) / N<br/>update local model
